!This is a dummy input file for Flaps2D

M 11
N 11

TimeStep 1.0e-18
TimeMax 100e-15
Text 80.0
RestartCalc 0

OutputIter 100

! Laser
Fluence 10.0e0
Wavelength 515.0e-9
PulseFWHM 40.0e-15

PolarizationSource 0
phiMie0 270.0
UseMieScattering -1 !-1: constant intensity, 0: some fittings, 1: Mie scattering.

! Model
DrudeHeating 1
TransportModel -1 !-1: disabled, 0: Fourier conduction, 1: Tritt particle transport (?), 2: ambipolar diffusion
ConvectionEnergy 0

!Debug options
AugerOff 1
NeOff 0
TeOff 1
HolesOff 1
TsOff 1
ImpactOff 1
CouplingDebug 1
CrossDiffusionOff 1
UseFermiDirac 0
